sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant H as Graph service
    participant S as SQLite adapter
    participant B as Index builder
    C->>H: Request scope and exact view
    H->>S: Resolve current access and pin generations
    S-->>H: Immutable source and layer identities
    B->>S: Publish sealed candidate with source and pointer revisions
    alt Revisions changed
        S-->>B: Conflict and retain published view
    else Revisions match
        S->>S: Commit pointer plus event and delivery
        S-->>B: Published
    end
    H->>S: Query pinned whole-unit overlay
    S->>S: Scope and masking before traversal or ranking
    H->>S: Revalidate access before text materialization
    alt Access revoked or pin expired
        H-->>C: Stale or unavailable without fallback
    else Valid
        H-->>C: Bounded result with exact citations
    end
